 "remarks": "Discover modern living in this 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom 'Carriage House' condo, perfectly positioned on the 4th floor as a rear corner unit with no overhead neighbors, ensuring exceptional privacy. The condo features an open floor plan with vaulted ceilings, newly installed laminate wood floors, and a cozy gas fireplace. The primary bedroom comes with a full bath and a walk-in closet. Enjoy central air, gas heating, and private storage conveniently located next to your reserved parking space in the gated garage. Revel in the stunning views of the treetops and the Five Mile River, and enjoy the convenience of being close to shopping, dining and just opened Wegmans I-95, and the Merritt Parkway.",
